    LLM: "Prioritize high-value trumps (Puur and NÃ¤ll). Always try to win the last trick for the bonus points. Learn to recognize your partner's 'signaling' through their discards.\n\nThe Push: If you have a mediocre hand, 'push' to your partner. If you have a solid suit (even if not 'pure' trumps), select it and lead aggressively.\n\nUndenufe/Obenabe mastery: These no-trump variants can score much higher points if you correctly identify that your hand is strong in 'Low' or 'High' cards respectively.",
